WEBVTT

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:06.580
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:16.770
<i>Chikara to chikara butsukareba,
When power collides with power,</i>

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:19.360
<i>arasoi wa hajimaru.
wars start.</i>

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:22.910
<i>Tatakau koto ga</i> yuuki <i>to</i>
I <i>don't think fighting</i>

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:24.910
<i>omowanai kedo...
equals bravery, but...</i>

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:27.310
<i>...mamoritai yo
...I want to protect</i>

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:29.870
kimi <i>no sono egao.
that smile on your face.</i>

00:00:32.050 --> 00:00:35.480
<i>Asu e no geeto
We can't see the gate</i>

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:38.180
<i>mienai keredo...
to tomorrow, but...</i>

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:41.960
<i>dare ni</i> demo <i>aru yo.
one's inside each of us.</i>

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:44.620
<i>Let's open the gate!</i>

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:49.330
Kinou <i>no namida</i> wa
<i>The tears we shed yesterday</i>

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:51.600
<i>kitto muda ja nai.
are probably not in vain.</i>

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:55.970
<i>Arasoi no nai</i> mirai wa
<i>A future without war</i>

00:00:55.970 --> 00:00:59.740
<i>ano tobira no mukougawa.
waits behind that door.</i>

00:01:00.110 --> 00:01:02.880
Mune <i>no oku</i> fukaku
<i>Retrieve the key lying</i>

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:06.820
<i>Jitto shimaikonda
deep inside your heart,</i>

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:09.620
<i>kagi wo takaku kakagete,
hold it up high,</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:11.850
<i>fumidasou!
and step out!</i>

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:16.160
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:01:16.730 --> 00:01:22.690
<i>You can open the gate!</i>

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:42.090
Order Your Christmas Cake!

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:47.940
It's Christmas time already.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:53.140
Yes... It has been nearly half a year
since I began acting as a Gate Super.

00:01:53.220 --> 00:01:54.770
Time passes quickly.

00:01:54.850 --> 00:01:57.510
Actually, you haven't done anything.

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:04.220
That's incredible, Kageyama!

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:06.420
Hi!

00:02:06.500 --> 00:02:11.060
Ukiya, have you heard?
Kageyama is amazing!

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:16.260
TV!  A live broadcast!

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:17.770
TV?

00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:19.470
This.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:23.110
The 9th Annual "Opinions of Youths”
National Conference

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:26.340
Oh, this is the program
they broadcast annually, right?

00:02:26.420 --> 00:02:29.350
Yeah. Our Political
Thoughts Club activities...

00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:33.150
...were noticed by the
producer of the show, you see.

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:35.450
He hastily invited us
to be on his show.

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:37.420
Hey, that's incredible!

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:41.120
I'm also pleased that our thus far slow
but steady activities are being recognized.

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:45.200
Keep up the good work!
I'll definitely watch the broadcast.

00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:47.170
Don't be such a stranger!

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:47.830
Huh?

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:51.310
I have seats for all of you, too.

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:56.170
I'll be therel! I might be able
to get on television as well!

00:02:56.250 --> 00:02:59.340
I have to use the phone!
I must call my family in Himeji...

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:02.910
...as well as Upperclassman Hachiman!
lf you'll excuse me...!

00:03:03.920 --> 00:03:05.980
I hope you can come
this time, too, Ruriko.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:08.890
Uh, s- sure.

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:19.570
See you!
Let's hurry.

00:03:22.070 --> 00:03:25.270
Kageyama has as much
acting power as ever.

00:03:28.410 --> 00:03:30.670
<i>December 24th..</i>

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:49.260
Give me its exact position!

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:52.930
It's no good, sir!
We've lost the response.

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:57.600
Similar to the time
with type-Fukuoka, hm...?

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:04.040
And to think that the
top secret radar network...

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:07.080
...of our Far Eastern branch
has been fortified since then.

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:14.410
Without a doubt, the invaders
are increasing in number.

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:20.230
Now that the Ki kai Shogun and Akuma
Hakushaku, two of the top executives...

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:24.860
...have been defeated,
who is leading the invaders?

00:04:42.020 --> 00:04:43.310
<i>Rejii Kageyama?!</i>

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:45.250
I- I'm sorry, sir!

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:49.280
Oh, please. I need you
to work more seriously.

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:52.020
Didn't I mention that
my orders are absolute?

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:57.030
Useless garbage.

00:04:58.370 --> 00:05:00.170
Shadow Edge!

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:09.670
Is that understood, fake human slime?

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:11.370
Yes, sir!

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:18.280
P- Please forgive us!

00:05:18.350 --> 00:05:22.850
I'd advise you to remember
who is master and who is servant.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:25.450
Yes! We will do as you say!

00:05:39.440 --> 00:05:41.770
No! That's not right!

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:42.710
Like this?

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:45.770
Don't put it through the top,
put it through the bottom!

00:05:45.850 --> 00:05:47.650
Through the bottom...!

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:04.870
I'm sorry. Once I get serious about
doing something, I put in too much oomph.

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:08.370
You can't help it.

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:11.810
But maybe you probably should
give up on a handmade scarf.

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:15.310
Not a chance! I can't let
Christmas pass me by!!!

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:20.940
It's my biggest chance to hit
Ukiya with all of my feelings!

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:22.750
Fei, pass me a knitting needle!

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:24.450
Coming right up!

00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:38.560
That is the 105th one.

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:40.100
Next!

00:06:51.150 --> 00:07:00.180
The 9th Annual "Opinions of Youths”
National Conference

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.680
What is that man plotting...?

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:45.060
Megumi is here!
Over here, over here!

00:07:45.970 --> 00:07:48.490
It's not as though I have
any interest in Kageyama...

00:07:48.570 --> 00:07:50.500
It's all right. You're in time.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:52.600
Okay. let's go!

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:57.700
They say you can look fatter on
television, so be careful everyone!

00:07:57.780 --> 00:07:59.750
I am Chotaro Banba!

00:07:59.820 --> 00:08:01.940
Mind your own business!

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:04.620
Opinions are a load of bull!

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:08.520
You know what they say about the fool
who listens to the opinion of a fool!

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:11.890
Hey, you! The cutie over there!
Listen to <i>my</i> opinion!

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:18.300
Hypocratic hippies. Hypocratic hippies are
the most hypothetically hip hippies around!

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:23.100
Who the heck are they?

00:08:23.170 --> 00:08:25.440
They are very vulgar hippies.

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:27.100
I think I'll go tell them off.

00:08:27.180 --> 00:08:29.540
It's best not to get involved.

00:08:30.250 --> 00:08:33.980
If we don't hurry,
it will start without us.

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:35.880
Oh, that's right!

00:08:35.950 --> 00:08:37.420
<i>Let' s hurry.</i>

00:08:37.490 --> 00:08:39.450
Yes, let's hurry!

00:08:45.030 --> 00:08:47.620
<i>Those pieces of human garbage...</i>

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:53.260
<i>Aren't they the ones I saw
at the construction site... P!</i>

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:03.180
Think of the legacy we will leave
our children and grandchildren!

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:05.940
A sky blackened with exhaust fumes?

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:11.580
Or crosswalks so dangerous,
pedestrians cannot cross safely? No!

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:14.380
Hey, you two!
We cannot leave such a horrible legacy!

00:09:14.460 --> 00:09:17.390
- Spitz was... the Supi-Gon...
That's right! Now is the time
to restrain our greed!

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:20.550
Honestly... What am I to do with you?

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:22.560
That's true...

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:24.160
Hot pork buns...

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:28.190
One stitch down,
one stitch up, down, up...

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:37.510
Naive. Her point on
the issue is too naive!

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:40.110
It's a useless, unresearched theory
that only looks good on paper.

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:43.480
No, it is a rich girl's delusion!

00:09:43.550 --> 00:09:45.520
That is what I believe!

00:09:48.390 --> 00:09:51.330
Now, in continuation,
the opinion of Reiji Kageyama...

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:54.450
...grade11 student of
Tategami Private High School.

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:58.200
Come on, guys. It's Kageyama!

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:01.270
Wake up, Fei!
That was a great nap!

00:10:01.340 --> 00:10:03.460
You, too, Kaoru...!
Oh, it's Kageyama.

00:10:04.010 --> 00:10:05.700
I wonder what he will say?

00:10:05.770 --> 00:10:07.970
I can hardly wait.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.480
Hi, everyone.

00:10:16.690 --> 00:10:18.980
He's handsome!
Groovy!

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:22.990
Recently, maggots are taking
over the world, aren't they?

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:27.990
Look around you. See?
Do you see the maggots?

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:33.230
We see maggots throwing their garbage
by the roadside without a second thought.

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:37.330
We see maggots performing acts of simple
violence in the name of political strife.

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:40.370
We see maggots using
leaded gasoline like water...

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:43.500
...dispersing exhaust
fumes into the air.

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:46.820
If you look around, you'll find
the world is full of maggots.

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:55.720
Some may be big and some may be small,
but maggots are still maggots.

00:10:56.190 --> 00:11:00.220
Insects like them should be crushed...
...with a 'squish,' like this.

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:02.490
Don't you agree?

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:05.720
What the heck is he talking about?

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:12.810
Well? Don't you agree, everyone?

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:22.280
<i>The world really is full of maggots.</i>

00:11:22.350 --> 00:11:26.620
<i>Not only that, the one, worst type
of maggot is the one closest to us.</i>

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:30.560
<i>The ones that don't get prosecuted.
However, the small violations committed...</i>

00:11:30.630 --> 00:11:34.620
<i>...by these maggots will eventually
build up and spoil the entire world.</i>

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:39.930
We are still okay now!
But 10, 20, and then 30 years from now...

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:44.930
...our world will most likely
have been destroyed by these maggots!

00:11:48.980 --> 00:11:51.670
This Is a live broadcast, right?

00:11:51.750 --> 00:11:53.210
Do you think it's okay?

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:56.840
Y- You!! What is the meaning of such
abusive language in a public forum?!

00:11:56.920 --> 00:12:01.750
Abusive language? Just now, I conveyed
my true, honest feelings on the matter.

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:04.950
And you call that abusive language?
I'm rather insulted.

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:09.660
We have no choice.
Interrupt the program!

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:12.700
Uh-uh... Let him continue.

00:12:13.870 --> 00:12:16.860
The fun part of the show
is about to begin.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:21.940
What? What's happening?!
ls it a stage show?

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:23.980
Look! He's holding a knife!

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:30.370
I heard what you said,
groovin' brother.

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:35.350
Maggots, eh? You're right.
The world is full of maggots...

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:36.860
That's true.

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:39.220
Hey, we see eye-to-eye, brother.

00:12:41.430 --> 00:12:45.390
That's right, they're here as well...
Maggots who call themselves hippies!

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:47.740
What did you say, brat?!

00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:50.770
You're saying we're maggots as well?!

00:12:50.840 --> 00:12:52.670
Am I mistaken?

00:12:52.740 --> 00:12:55.900
That does it! Now I'm pissed off!

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:01.350
Stop it, maggots!

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:02.320
This is bad!

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:05.790
Yes. lf we don't do something,
Kageyama will be torn apart!

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:09.380
That's not what I meant!
I'm worried about the hippies!

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:10.420
What?

00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:14.490
Hey, hey! Are you all talk,
no action, or what?

00:13:15.530 --> 00:13:18.930
I don't want to resort to violence...
However...!

00:13:41.860 --> 00:13:45.190
Let your guard down, and
maggots will show up anywhere!

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:49.030
On your street corners, in your
schools, across the whole world...!

00:13:49.100 --> 00:13:50.900
That is why I will crush them!

00:13:51.900 --> 00:13:54.030
For the sake of the tomorrow
we call "the future!"

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:56.300
Stop it, Kageyama!

00:13:59.070 --> 00:14:01.800
Hey!  Are you going to help me out?

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:06.740
They're already out cold.
just let them go now!

00:14:06.810 --> 00:14:10.770
I told you once before, remember?
It's not healthy to hesitate.

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:14.850
I am going to exterminate maggots
who threaten our society once and for all!

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:17.520
They may be maggots to you,
but they're still human beings!

00:14:17.590 --> 00:14:19.460
No, they are not human!

00:14:19.530 --> 00:14:22.460
What separates humans
from the cats and dogs?!

00:14:22.530 --> 00:14:27.130
Intellect! We have the intellect to
suppress our instincts, respect others...

00:14:27.470 --> 00:14:30.490
...for the sake of establishing
a better society!

00:14:30.570 --> 00:14:35.640
That is why I say those who cannot
make proper judgment are not human!

00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:37.840
Stop!

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:39.880
Stop it now, Kageyama!

00:14:40.880 --> 00:14:42.440
Are you gonna stop me?

00:14:42.520 --> 00:14:44.510
You had bloody well
better believe I am!

00:14:44.590 --> 00:14:45.520
Why?

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:47.820
Sophisticated arguments don't matter!

00:14:47.890 --> 00:14:51.660
I'm going to stop you only because
I think you're going overboard!

00:15:05.140 --> 00:15:07.110
What's this?!

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:13.440
Paranormal frequencies registered!
In the vicinity of WHK Hall in Shibuya!

00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:16.580
Contact the Gate Keepers immediately!

00:15:16.650 --> 00:15:18.810
Commander!
What is it?

00:15:18.890 --> 00:15:20.750
Please look at the screen!!

00:15:30.100 --> 00:15:33.090
Establish a super-jamming wave over
the entire metropolitan region immediately!

00:15:33.170 --> 00:15:36.070
The public must not view this image!!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:38.840
Please Stand By

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:40.380
Oh?
Please Stand By

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:41.210
Please Stand By

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:59.090
This is Ukiya!
Please respond! Please respond!

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:04.200
It's no good. I can't get through.
We'll have to fight on our own judgment.

00:16:04.270 --> 00:16:06.320
But the public is still present!

00:16:06.400 --> 00:16:11.310
We'll keep the gate power down to a minimum,
and fight like normal high school students!

00:16:11.640 --> 00:16:15.040
Roger, normal high school students!

00:16:15.710 --> 00:16:17.700
Help!

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:19.750
Arrow of Light!

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:24.020
Uh...

00:16:24.090 --> 00:16:27.110
I mean, I'm practicing
for our archery club!

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:30.020
Clogs of Power!

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:33.760
Uh, I mean...

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:38.130
..."normal clogs!" It's hard
to fight while hiding my power!

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:41.130
Explosive Panda Fire Ball!

00:16:44.670 --> 00:16:48.510
Ayaya! No, no! I mean, it's
probably a gas explosion... yeah.

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:53.510
Let's see... has anyone
seen a piano around here?

00:16:53.750 --> 00:16:57.690
Face! Torso! I have a
kendo tournament tomorrow!

00:16:57.750 --> 00:16:59.720
Here I go!!

00:17:01.760 --> 00:17:04.350
Big ball roll!!

00:17:07.230 --> 00:17:09.750
Now I'm completely ready for
the athletic festival tomorrow.

00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:11.530
Huh?

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:18.300
My present for Ukiyal!

00:17:18.370 --> 00:17:21.740
Don't touch that!!!

00:17:22.210 --> 00:17:24.180
Get out of here, quickly!

00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:32.450
<i>Rem Kageyama...</i>

00:17:35.560 --> 00:17:37.520
<i>The evil gate keeper.</i>

00:17:54.810 --> 00:17:59.750
Now, you're finished!
Ultra Cyclone Chopl!

00:18:13.830 --> 00:18:17.130
What was that?!
I saw a strange ring of lightl!

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:20.460
N- No, you didn't!
That was a... a...

00:18:26.210 --> 00:18:27.800
Excellent, Ukiya.

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:29.670
Kageyama...

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:42.280
I have seen what you can do.

00:18:42.360 --> 00:18:47.120
It's not like that! That
was... like a little magic trick...

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:48.720
Why?

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:54.890
If you have that much power,
why do you hesitate to crush maggots?

00:18:54.970 --> 00:18:57.440
Look around you
at the state of this hall!!

00:19:00.510 --> 00:19:05.540
If you hadn't stopped me a moment ago,
it may not have been this badly damaged!!

00:19:05.610 --> 00:19:09.740
Th- That's a consequence! At the time,
I thought they were ordinary humans...

00:19:09.820 --> 00:19:11.790
Consequences are everything!

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:15.320
Paranormal frequency,
completely disappeared!

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:19.190
Um, Commander, our phone
lines are flooding with calls...

00:19:19.260 --> 00:19:23.250
...from every affected government
office about the super jamming wave.

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:25.960
Understood. Remove
the super jamming wave.

00:19:27.870 --> 00:19:32.710
<i>That is why I will eliminate
every last maggot of society...</i>

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:37.180
...before our future resembles
this hall! Yes! I will fight...

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:41.310
...to preserve the smiles on all of your
faces! I will fight until the bitter end!

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:44.590
My! It's a student from our school!

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:48.420
Commander?

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:56.230
What? For me?

00:19:56.300 --> 00:20:00.790
I... I knitted it for you
with all my heart and soul...

00:20:00.870 --> 00:20:03.340
...but in the confusion, it was...

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:07.170
...but that's okay. My stitching
was horrible from the very beginning...

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:11.300
...and it's twisted up here and there,
and if you look closely, it's really...

00:20:16.550 --> 00:20:18.580
You worked hard on that, Kaoru.

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:20.850
Ikusawa?

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:22.820
Right, Ukiya?

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:27.450
Yeah! I always wanted
a red scarf like heroes wear!

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:30.090
Do you mean it?!
Of course!

00:20:32.300 --> 00:20:35.460
How do I look?
I'm so jealous, Ukiya!

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:38.200
It's almost too good for him.

00:20:38.270 --> 00:20:40.300
It looks warm!

00:20:41.310 --> 00:20:43.440
Th- Thank you.

00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:46.480
Aren't you happy, Kaoru?
Yeah!

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:50.380
About that scarf...
I have a small request, Ukiya!

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:53.110
No way! I'm not gonna
let you borrow it.

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:55.710
Don't be like that!
just for a little while!

00:21:00.430 --> 00:21:02.400
POLITICAL THOUGHTS CLUB

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:19.840
Hi. I've been expecting you.

00:21:20.450 --> 00:21:23.380
I heard your speech.

00:21:24.120 --> 00:21:25.980
Did it make an impression on you?

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:27.850
You...

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:30.260
You are a big, fat liar.

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:43.770
I want your power.

00:21:45.370 --> 00:21:49.940
Not anyone else's power.
I want the power only you have.

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:54.440
Welcome to the
Political Thoughts Club!

00:21:55.480 --> 00:21:57.450
POLITICAL THOUGHTS CLUB

00:22:07.270 --> 00:22:10.970
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:22:10.970 --> 00:22:14.840
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:22:14.940 --> 00:22:19.810
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:22:20.350 --> 00:22:23.190
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:22:23.190 --> 00:22:25.320
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:30.490
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:22:30.490 --> 00:22:33.830
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:22:33.830 --> 00:22:38.460
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:22:39.170 --> 00:22:43.330
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:22:43.410 --> 00:22:47.970
<i>kyou kara asu e to
from today to tomorrow,</i>

00:22:48.440 --> 00:22:54.750
boku-tachi wa aruite yuku yo.
we will walk toward the future.
